      "text": "\"Gray Box Testing\"",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "g3B_qiHSt4ljIh1UjIlQh",
      "originalText": "\"Gray Box Testing\"",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "770BCuvxUfVILt3LJWtiR",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 710,
      "y": 297,
      "width": 801.7793579101562,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aA",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 502362605,
      "version": 124,
      "versionNonce": 1574772547,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789583835044,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Some things can't be system tested. \n    - these are technically Unit Integration Tests - but you can use test doubles.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Some things can't be system tested. \n    - these are technically Unit Integration Tests - but you can use test doubles.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "XWnfCZWnfrWRHvUkxbN6W",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 431,
      "y": 744,
      "width": 857.659423828125,
      "height": 625,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aB",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2120059907,
      "version": 570,
      "versionNonce": 708303085,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789583779875,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "deposits made on the account during business hours get a 10% bonus.\ndeposits outside of the business hours get no bonus.\n\n\nWhen the code I'm testing has to interact with some other service (GET, POST, ETC.)\n    - I need to know that I made the request properly, but I can't test their stuff.\n    - And I need to make sure that if their service fails, I don't fall over dead, too. \n\n\n\nPOST /shows\nContent-type: application/json\n\n{\n\"title\": \"Silo\",\n\"genre\": \"Sci-Fi\"\n}\n\n\n201 Created\n\n{\n  \"id\": \"....\",\n....\n}",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "deposits made on the account during business hours get a 10% bonus.\ndeposits outside of the business hours get no bonus.\n\n\nWhen the code I'm testing has to interact with some other service (GET, POST, ETC.)\n    - I need to know that I made the request properly, but I can't test their stuff.\n    - And I need to make sure that if their service fails, I don't fall over dead, too. \n\n\n\nPOST /shows\nContent-type: application/json\n\n{\n\"title\": \"Silo\",\n\"genre\": \"Sci-Fi\"\n}\n\n\n201 Created\n\n{\n  \"id\": \"....\",\n....\n}",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
